The prediction backbone in src/wm_ms3m/ derives from:
  https://github.com/frezazadeh/agentic-wm_ms3m
  source revision: 29e862d9484ee237eecf669247f29e5db76231f1
  paper: Agentic World Modeling for 6G: Near-Real-Time Generative
         State-Space Reasoning, arXiv:2511.02748
  license: MIT; complete original notice in third_party/WM-MS3M-LICENSE.

The published core.py is byte-identical to the locally validated backbone
(SHA-256 05a723ee538cca0374e9823ac08a285406f05b9bde9e8851908c0ade5372d6c1).
This revision identifier names the upstream base; local compatibility fixes
are described in third_party/README.md. CT-WM does not claim authorship of
the existing SSM/latent backbone or affiliation with its original authors.

Original additions include experiment adapters, interval diagnostics,
lightweight planning and link abstractions, packaging, and analysis.
The E2 objects model application semantics using local JSON. They do not
implement ASN.1 E2SM/E2AP, SCTP transport, or a production RIC.

